<h1 align="center">Dice Mind: Mestre da Probabilidade</h1>

<p align="center">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Educativo-0D1B6E?style=for-the-badge" alt="Educativo">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/Probabilidade-1E3A8A?style=for-the-badge" alt="Probabilidade">
